    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "340332597B9C9C2D",
      "text": "¡De eso no ando corta, precisamente! ¡Se van a\\nenterar en esta academia de lo que es bueno![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "FE0ADD0D0B1D9A3D",
      "text": "¡Ja! ¿Quieres que enseñe todo lo que sé acerca\\nde combatir?\\c\\nEn una academia en la que dan tanta importancia\\na los combates como esta, ¡no vendrá mal![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04c",
      "hash64": "FE0ADC0D0B1D988A",
      "text": "¡¿Y esto a qué viene, novatill[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa?!\\n¿Te me has hecho viej[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa de repente?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
